## Why This Is Asked
Tests ability to design automated degradation with controlled risk during external dependency pressure and multi-region operation.

## Key Concepts
- Circuit breakers and failover
- Per-region degradation strategies
- Idempotent queues and exactly-once delivery
- Canary and synthetic testing
- Rollback criteria and observability

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo-code for circuit breaker state machine
class CircuitBreaker {
  constructor(threshold, resetTime) {
    this.threshold = threshold;
    this.resetTime = resetTime;
    this.failures = 0;
    this.state = 'CLOSED';
  }
  onFailure() {
    this.failures++;
    if (this.failures > this.threshold) this.state = 'OPEN';
  }
  canRequest() { return this.state !== 'OPEN'; }
}
```

## Follow-up Questions
- How would you adapt this for multi-tenant services with mixed SLIs?
- How would you validate degradation paths in canaries without impacting customers?

## Why This Is Asked

Assesss real-world ability to design resilient, low-tail-latency multi-region pipelines under stress while preserving tenant fairness and clear rollback paths.

## Key Concepts

- Backpressure and circuit breaking in streaming pipelines
- Per-tenant QoS and traffic shaping
- Exactly-once processing guarantees across Kafka and sinks
- Observability for SLO-driven tail latency
- Chaos testing and incident rollback discipline

## Code Example

```javascript
// Pseudo: bounded per-tenant backpressure
function handleEvent(event, tenant) {
  const q = queues[tenant];
  if (q.length < MAX_PER_TENANT) {
    enqueue(event, tenant);
  } else {
    drop(event); // apply backpressure upstream
  }
}
```

## Follow-up Questions

- How would you validate the degradation plan with synthetic workloads?
- What metrics would you use to decide when to restore normal traffic?

## Why This Is Asked
Tests ability to manage tenant-level reliability with shared budgets and fast containment.

## Key Concepts
- Per-tenant SLOs and error budgets
- Tenant-scoped routing and feature flags
- Tenant-level telemetry and alerting
- Safe rollback and RCA

## Code Example
